// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
//menwei.c
inherit NPC;
void create()
{
	set_name("仕卫", ({"shi wei", "wei"}) );
	set("gender", "男性" );
	set("age", 25);
	set("long", "这是个样子威严的仕卫。\n");
	set("attitude", "friendly");
	set("shen_type", -1);
	set("str", 22);
	set("int", 23);
	set("con", 22);
	set("dex", 21);
	set("max_qi", 400);
	set("max_jing", 300);
	set("neili", 200);
	set("max_neili", 200);
	set("combat_exp", 3500+random(1000));
	set("score", 3000);
	set_temp("apply/attack", 30);
	set_temp("apply/defense", 20);
	set_temp("apply/damage", 20);
	set_temp("apply/armor",20);
	setup();
	add_money("silver",20);
	carry_object("/d/baituo/obj/dadao")->wield();
}
